OL,3,AUS condemns 'unnecessary escalation'
OL,4,Aafter Israeli airstrikes on Syrian
OL,5,Aairbase
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe United States has issued a rare
OL,8,Frebuke of Israel after reports emerged
OL,9,Fit struck a Syrian military airbase
OL,10,Fnear the Turkish border, calling the
OL,11,Fattack an "unnecessary escalation".
OL,13,FEight airstrikes hit the Abu Duhur
OL,14,Fairport runway and storage facility on
OL,15,FTuesday, according to Syrian state TV,
OL,16,Falthough there were no reports of
OL,17,Finjuries.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
