OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUS condemns 'unnecessary escalation'
OL,4,Aafter Israeli airstrikes on Syrian
OL,5,Aairbase
OL,6,
OL,7,FIsrael, while not commenting on the
OL,8,Fstrikes directly, said Syria "was on
OL,9,Fthe verge of breaching" the security
OL,10,Fstatus quo, accusing Damascus of
OL,11,Fallowing Turkish troops to deploy to
OL,12,Fthe airbase.
OL,14,FSyria and Turkey blamed the Israeli
OL,15,Fmilitary for the attacks that they said
OL,16,Fthreaten to escalate tensions in the
OL,17,Fregion.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
